"1091" data-end="1107"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="Silychristin">Silychristin</span></strong></p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="1109" data-end="1294"><p class="" data-start="1111" data-end="1294"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="Think of silymarin as a toolbox">Think of silymarin as a toolbox</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="silybin is the wrench">silybin is the wrench</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="silydianin the screwdriver">silydianin the screwdriver</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="and silychristin the pliers">and silychristin the pliers</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="Each has a role">Each has a role</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="but together they help repair and protect your liver">but together they help repair and protect your liver</span>.</p></blockquote><h3 class="" data-start="1296" data-end="1317"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_does_it_work"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="How does it work">How does it work</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ol data-start="1319" data-end="1932"><li class="" data-start="1319" data-end="1468"><p class="" data-start="1322" data-end="1468"><strong data-start="1322" data-end="1343"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="Antioxidant Power">Antioxidant Power</span></strong><br data-start="1343" data-end="1346" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="Silymarin neutralizes free radicals and reduces oxidative stress">Silymarin neutralizes free radicals and reduces oxidative stress</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="like applying a rust-proof coating to your liver cells">like applying a rust-proof coating to your liver cells</span>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1470" data-end="1590"><p class="" data-